{
  "opencollection": "1.0.0",
  "info": {
    "name": "Nursa Public API V2 Clinicians API",
    "version": "2"
  },
  "request": {
    "auth": {
      "type": "bearer",
      "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
    }
  },
  "items": [
    {
      "info": {
        "name": "Clinicians",
        "type": "folder"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Get Clinician Details",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://public-api.prod.nursa.com/api/v2/public/clinicians/:clinicianId/details",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "clinicianId",
                "value": "I7002epLHLhBCypdPCrn9XP4kTN2",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Clinician ID"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "<h3>General Information</h3>\n<p>This endpoint allows you to retrieve <strong>clinician information</strong></p>\n"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Get Clinician Documents",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://public-api.prod.nursa.com/api/v2/public/clinicians/:clinicianId/documents",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "clinicianId",
                "value": "I7002epLHLhBCypdPCrn9XP4kTN2",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Clinician ID"
              },
              {
                "name": "shiftId",
                "value": "4603117571",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Id of the shift"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "<h3>General Information</h3>\n<p>This endpoint allows facilities to retrieve a list of all documents associated with a specific clinician.</p>\n<h4><strong>Required Parameters</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>clinicianId</strong> (path parameter): The unique identifier of the clinician</li>\n<li><strong>shiftId</strong> (query parameter): The shift ID which the clinician requested</li>\n</ul>\n<h4><strong>Document Categories</strong></h4>\n<p>The endpoint returns documents organized by the following cat"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Download Clinician Document attachment",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://public-api.prod.nursa.com/api/v2/public/clinicians/:clinicianId/documents/attachment/:attachmentId",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "clinicianId",
                "value": "I7002epLHLhBCypdPCrn9XP4kTN2",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Clinician ID"
              },
              {
                "name": "attachmentId",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Id of the attachment"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "<h3>General Information</h3>\n<p>This endpoint allows you to download a specific attachment file associated with a clinician's document.</p>\n<h4><strong>Required Parameters</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>clinicianId</strong> (path parameter): The unique identifier of the clinician</li>\n<li><strong>attachmentId</strong> (path parameter): The unique identifier of the specific attachment to download</li>\n</ul>\n<h4><strong>File Handling</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Files are streamed directly to the client"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Get Clinician Document attachments",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://public-api.prod.nursa.com/api/v2/public/clinicians/:clinicianId/documents/:category/:documentId",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "clinicianId",
                "value": "I7002epLHLhBCypdPCrn9XP4kTN2",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Clinician ID"
              },
              {
                "name": "category",
                "value": "license",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Category of the document"
              },
              {
                "name": "documentId",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Id of the document"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "<h3>General Information</h3>\n<p>This endpoint retrieves all file attachments associated with a specific clinician document.</p>\n<h4><strong>Required Parameters</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>clinicianId</strong> (path parameter): The unique identifier of the clinician</li>\n<li><strong>category</strong> (path parameter): The document category (LICENSE, CREDENTIAL, BACKGROUND_CHECK, SSN, CDPH_530)</li>\n<li><strong>documentId</strong> (path parameter): The unique identifier of the specific document"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "bundled": true
}